## RhythmFold

Real life interrupts focus—your timer should fold the interruption in, not punish you for it.

RhythmFold is a calm, privacy-focused focus timer for students, knowledge workers, and anyone whose attention gets interrupted. Start a session in one tap, pause or resume without losing your place, and keep every record yours.

FOCUS WITHOUT FRICTION

• One-tap start with an optional task name—no account, no ads, no paywall before your first completed session
• Pause, end, restart, or mark a legitimate interruption; the task, phase, and time always stay visible
• Customizable focus/break cycles and tags for every kind of work
• Bundled ambient soundscapes with a silent option—never an audio ad
• Live Activities and notifications that end cleanly and never linger

RECOVER AND REVIEW

• Automatic saving and crash recovery, down to the second
• Local history with search, basic statistics, and a 30-day undo for deletions
• Read-only calendar context to start a session from your next event

YOURS ON EVERY DEVICE

• Free basic iCloud sync between iPhone and iPad through your own Apple account
• Full JSON backup/restore and open CSV export, always free
• Optional app lock with Face ID, Touch ID, or a passcode

RHYTHMFOLD PLUS — ONE PURCHASE, NO SUBSCRIPTION

Unlock an optional set of advanced tools:

• Schedule orchestration with rhythm templates, calendar planning, and Shortcuts automation
• Professional insights with 30/90/365-day trends, custom goals, and polished PDF reports

The free RhythmFold experience always stays ad-free. Your local sessions, history, backups, CSV and JSON exports, and restore remain available without RhythmFold Plus.

RhythmFold is available in English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, and Spanish.

Fold real interruptions into a rhythm you can keep—and keep your data yours.
